# Obsidian memory + learning brain (always)

Read before sponsor/client work:

1. `context_docs/obsidian/HOME.md`
2. `context_docs/obsidian/Wanted vs Not Okay.md`
3. `context_docs/obsidian/Never Again.md`
4. `context_docs/obsidian/Editorial Learning.md`
5. HPM note when touching that ad

## Learning is a major subsystem

- Daily: `python -m autoedit.learning daily` (podcasts / talking_head / long_form / shorts)
- Rate every delivered edit **-1 (bad) … 20 (perfect)** — target 18+
- Every dislike → `python -m autoedit.learning dislike "…" --situation <context>`
- Never show a sponsor until `sponsor_qc.review_and_fix` + never-again rules pass

## Hard creative rules (HPM)

- Original first-ad upbeat music only; seamless; no typing/click SFX
- No 80s navy/gold cards; modern kinetic over live house
- No shaky tails
